FleetMiner Core: one script for a whole mining fleet over IGC.
Roles: Miner, Hauler (Site or Shuttle), Carrier, Mothership.

SETUP
  1. Load the script into a Programmable Block, then edit its Custom Data.
     Recompile once to write every key with its default value.
       [FleetMiner]
       Role=Miner          ; Miner | Hauler | Carrier | Mothership
       HaulMode=Site       ; Haulers: Site (bays at the work site) | Shuttle (carrier -> mothership)
       Channel=FLEETMINER  ; same on every ship (HQ traffic uses Channel/HQ)
       FleetKey=           ; same secret on every ship
       Callsign=MINER-1    ; HUD / screen name (empty = grid name)
  2. Drones: Remote Control facing the drill direction, gyros, thrusters on all
     six sides, a broadcasting antenna, a connector tagged [FM Dock].
     Site haulers add [FM Bay] connectors. Run 'selftest'.
  3. Optional (drone): [FM Cam] camera, [FM Eject] sorter + ejector,
     [FM Sensor] sensor, decoys, [FM Flee] AI Defensive block, [FM Light] lights.
  4. Bases: [FM Dock] pads, [FM Pad N] pad lights, [FM Searchlight],
     [FM Unload] cargo containers.
  5. Screens: [FM LCD] [FM Gauges] [FM Map] / [FM Map N] [FM Board] [FM Log] [FM Stats]
  6. Hooks (timers trigger, sound blocks play): [FM <State>] and
     [FM Backout] [FM Rich] [FM Holding] [FM Launch] [FM Distress] [FM LinkLost]
  Full guide: docs/MinerDrone.md in the source repo.

DRONE COMMANDS (PB argument)
  setsite [N]  Aim at the rock face and run. N (0-7) shares it via the carrier.
  site N       Join carrier library site N.
  start        Self-test, then the automatic cycle.
  return       Back out of the shaft, fly home and dock. The cycle stops.
  stop         Halt in place; dampeners on.
  skip | goto N | resetsite | forget

CARRIER / MOTHERSHIP COMMANDS
  launch | recall | halt   Fleet orders (the mothership's reach every carrier).
  assign N                 Send everyone below to library site N.
  reset                    Clear pad reservations and queues.

ANY ROLE
  status | selftest | set <Key> <Value> | resetstats

MODS
  Mining lasers (Adjustable Mining Laser, ToolCore tools) are used automatically
  when they face forward on a miner: it bores each shaft from outside.
  chart N GPS:Name:X:Y:Z:   (miner or carrier) fly to a GPS, chart it as site N.
  WeaponCore threats and Defense Shields are picked up automatically.
